NATIONAL ASSEMBLY SECRETARIAT
ORDERS OF THE DAYfor the meeting of the National Assembly to be held on Tuesday, the l8n Febru ary,2025 at I I :00 a.m.
l. Tilawat, Hadith, Naat and national anthem.CALLING ATTENTION NOTICE2. SYED WASEEM HUSSAIN SYED AMIN UL HAQMR MUHAMMAD MOIN AAIVIER PIRZADA MR MUIIAMMAD JAWED IIANIF KHANSYED MUSTUFA KAMAL to invite attention of the Minister for Communications to amatter of urgent public importance regarding the collection of extra toll tax at various locations on Karachi-Hyderabad M-9 motorway, causing grave concem amongst the public.INTRODUCTION OF BILLS
3. RANA MTIIIAMMAD QASIM NOON to move for leave to introduce a Bill to providefor the establishment of Orbit Institute of Management and Technology [The Orbit Institute of Managementand Technology B ill, 20251.4. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is granted.
5. MR. NA\'EED AAMIRMR. RAMESH LALDR. SHAZIA SOBIA ASLAM SOOMROMIRZA IKHTIAR BAIGSYED ALI QASIM GILLAM to move for leave to introduce a Bill to establish aNational Commission for Minorities Rights [The National Commission for Minorities' Riglts Bill, 2025].6, Also to introduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.
PRESENTATION OF REPORT OF
THE STAIIDING COMMITTEE
7. MR. AZIM UDDIN ZAlIlD, Chairman Standing Committee on Federal Education, ProfessionalTraining, National Heritage and Culture to present the report of the Standing Committee on the Bill toprovide for the establishment ofthe Ghurki Institute of Science and Technology [The Ghurki Institute ofScience and Technology Bill, 20241. (Moved by Ms. Samina Khalid Ghurki, MNA)LEGISLATIVE BUSINESS
